# Per-quantization environment for gufo@.service on the rank 0 host.
# Install as ~/.config/gufo/<quant>.env on the rank 0 host (the rank 1
# host receives GUFO_MODEL from it); the service instance
# name selects the file, and a missing file fails the start cleanly.
#
# q8:
GUFO_MODEL=/opt/models/qwen3.8-flash-next/Q8_0/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Q8_0-00001-of-00006.gguf
#
# q4 (instead of the line above):
# GUFO_MODEL=/opt/models/qwen3.8-flash-next/UD-Q4_K_XL/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-UD-Q4_K_XL-00001-of-00004.gguf
